        "id": 117038,
        "name": "j1hopki1",
        "username": "j1hopki1",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-05T18:46:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The real reason to play Recharge Mode is NOT the extra&nbsp;cards. It's the -1 damage. With Armor Plating and Recharge Mode Bunker has a -2. Very few heroes can set up a -2 DR.&nbsp;Against some villains (Matirarch, Vengance Team)&nbsp;that is the difference between winning and losing.</p><p>True, no one likes sitting around drawing cards. That's probably&nbsp;the bigger reason why Recharge Mode is not played more.</p><p>Playing Gattling Gun or&nbsp;the&nbsp;Omni Cannon before Recharge Mode&nbsp;lets you&nbsp;still contribute while you&nbsp;super tank.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:49:37.203Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
