        "created_at": "2014-09-05T19:51:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Then again, if you have your Omni-Cannon out as well, you can be charging that up with all the cards you're drawing, ready to nuke something with it later once you've got half your deck stashed away, the villain is nearly dead, or something just really needs to die <span class=\"bbcode-i\">right now</span> ;).</p>",
