        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The recharge mode section says he is losing 2 phases on his first turn. However since Recharge Mode also gives damage reduction of 1, wouldn&#39;t that mean only the Power Phase is lost, as his play gave him a benefit outside of only drawing cards? It&#39;s equal to playing Heavy Plating and using Initialize in the same turn, the only difference is following round, where Bunker can draw 3 if Recharge Mode is in play.</p><p>Mistform also provides a gameplay benefit outside of just drawing cards.</p><p>Also Prayer of Desperation. It is possible to draw 0 cards from it.</p><p>Kill On Sight, perhaps a note stating that the target actually has to be removed from play to gain the benefits of the drawing?</p><p>Supply Crate&nbsp;seems to be under the assumption that Unity is able to use a power, either by already having a COnstruction Pylon or Modular Workbench in play, another option being she destroys someone else&#39;s equipment card. If none of these conditions are able to be met, then she would be losing her Power Phase as well. Brainstorm also falls under this.</p>",
